        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;&#39; -------------------- 4. ACTIVITY: UC-03 --------------------\n@startuml Sada_Activity_UC03\ntitle UC-03 — Analyze Audio Recording\nskinparam shadowing false\nskinparam defaultFontName Arial\nstart\n:Receive assessment request from Sada Platform;\n:Create temporary AI scratch file;\n:Validate file header and integrity;\nif (File is readable and supported?) then (Yes)\n :Measure duration, silence ratio and clipping;\n if (Audio quality sufficient?) then (Yes)\n  :Convert signal to mono 16 kHz;\n  :Normalize signal amplitude;\n  :Segment audio into configured analysis windows;\n  :Run deepfake classifier on audio windows;\n  :Aggregate window scores into final spoof score;\n  :Load calibrated decision threshold;\n  :Store assessment and traceability metadata;\n  :Delete temporary AI scratch file;\n  :Return score, quality status and metadata;\n else (No)\n  :Store INSUFFICIENT_QUALITY assessment;\n  :Delete temporary AI scratch file;\n  :Return insufficient-quality status;\n endif\nelse (No)\n :Store validation failure metadata;\n :Delete scratch file if created;\n :Return invalid-audio error;\nendif\nstop\n@enduml&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="vPecKsJ7qy07KvzmN1Pw-1">
